            <button id="nextSlideBtn" class="absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-11 h-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition hover:scale-110 cursor-pointer text-white text-xl z-10"
                    style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);" aria-label="Next">
                ›
